        <ul>
          <li><strong>When:</strong> Friday, October 16 (check-in 4pm) → Sunday, October 18 (10am)</li>
          <li><strong>Where:</strong> Woodlands Retreat, Nunnelly, TN — about an hour west of Nashville. Lodge bedding provided.</li>
          <li><strong>Who:</strong> the CTA community and friends — space is limited</li>
          <li><strong>Meals:</strong> catered dinners Friday and Saturday; shared breakfasts and lunch</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
